{
  "name": "Instanced Flock",
  "description": "2048 boids from a Feedback simulation drawn as real winged meshes by a Render 3D node: instanced bird meshes aligned with their velocity, wings flapped in the vertex shader, soft sun shadows on the ground, sky, fog and bloom. Reacts to music (separation bursts, beat flares). Parameters: Flock, Birds, Look, Music.",
  "version": "1.0",
  "timestamp": "2026-10-25T20:19:40.217Z",
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -118,
        "data": {
          "text": "# Instanced Flock\n2048 boids simulated in one rgba32f Feedback and drawn as real winged meshes by a Render 3D node: one instanced draw call, wings flapped in the vertex shader, soft sun shadows on the ground, fog, sky and bloom.\n- Tweak it in the Parameters panel (P): Flock, Birds, Look, Music.\n- Orbit: the camera is an Orbital Camera (Camera speed / distance).",
          "width": 420,
          "height": 150,
          "color": "yellow"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -78,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Boid sim\nFeedback 64 x 64 rgba32f: rows 0-31 = positions, 32-63 = velocities (Instance Data layout, blocks = 2). Every boid checks every other within the perception radius (2048^2 tests per frame).",
          "width": 300,
          "height": 110,
          "color": "blue"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -88,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Birds\nBird Mesh instanced 2048 times: Instances From Texture puts each bird at its position and turns it along its velocity. Wing Flap (Mesh.displace) bends the wings per vertex; the material colours birds by instance id.",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 120,
          "color": "violet"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -88,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Scene\nRender 3D: birds, ground, glowing grid, sun with a soft shadow map, sky light. The background is a sky shaded per camera ray (Camera Ray with the same camera), the fog fades to the horizon colour.",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 120,
          "color": "green"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -58,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Post\nBright pass into a small Feedback, blurred back on top (bloom), vignette, highlight roll-off.",
          "width": 280,
          "height": 90,
          "color": "orange"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -78,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Music\ndrive = music x smoothstep(0.02, 0.12, level): separation bursts and the flock speeds up with the music. Beat pulses flare the bloom and the wing tips: Beat (clock stable, gate fade) pulse x confidence, so they come from the stable beat clock and fade out while it is unsure (a track change) and with the audio off.",
          "width": 300,
          "height": 110,
          "color": "pink"
        }
      },
